1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,514
Open the soft phone, and choose the Work tab.

2
00:00:06,514 --> 00:00:09,412
You sign in here, not from My workspace.

3
00:00:09,412 --> 00:00:11,870
It reads Signed out until you do.

4
00:00:12,332 --> 00:00:15,574
Under Queues, select the queues you work today.

5
00:00:15,574 --> 00:00:20,162
With agent entitlements, you only see the queues you are entitled to.

6
00:00:20,162 --> 00:00:22,242
Campaigns work the same way.

7
00:00:22,693 --> 00:00:23,901
Click Sign in.

8
00:00:23,901 --> 00:00:26,981
You must pick at least one queue or campaign.

9
00:00:26,981 --> 00:00:31,512
You then become Available, and the Work tab lists each queue with its

10
00:00:31,512 --> 00:00:33,083
own Sign out button.

11
00:00:33,535 --> 00:00:37,351
Sign out leaves one queue and keeps you in the others.

12
00:00:37,351 --> 00:00:40,785
At the end of your shift, click Sign out of all.

